      "translationZh": "标题：SinkPruner：面向多模态大语言模型的无注意力汇聚视觉词元剪枝",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e087dc1f65c531a9",
